@startuml
title US-03: Submit Borrow Request
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor Borrower
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database DB

Borrower -> Frontend : Submit dates & reason
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/requests
Backend -> DB : Fetch Item (ownerId, status)
DB --> Backend : Item details

alt Own item
    Backend --> Frontend : 400 Bad Request
    Frontend --> Borrower : Cannot borrow own item
else Item unavailable
    Backend --> Frontend : 409 Conflict
    Frontend --> Borrower : Item unavailable
else Valid request
    Backend -> DB : Save BorrowRequest (PENDING)
    DB --> Backend : Saved
    Backend --> Frontend : 201 Created
    Frontend --> Borrower : Show Pending status
end
@enduml
